WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.700
[Engine coughs.]

00:00.700 --> 00:01.500
[Engine revs. Energy rises.]

00:01.500 --> 00:02.700
[Tires squeal.]

00:02.700 --> 00:03.350
[Rushing air.]

00:03.350 --> 00:04.150
[A heavy collision. Tires scatter.]

00:04.150 --> 00:05.800
[A wheel rattles and rolls away.]
